        "original_id": "2a602046-1683-5600-a157-a38d06b54508",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Bullenbeisser, Can de Palleiro, Boxer\n- Places: Galicia, Spain\n- Concepts: dog breeds, extinction, crossbreeding, breed origins\n\nFacts:\n- The Bullenbeisser, also called the German Bulldog, was a dog breed known for strength and agility.\n- The Can de Palleiro, also called Pastor Galego, Galician Shepherd Dog, or Galician Palleiro, is a dog breed originating in Galicia, Spain.\n- The Boxer was bred from the Old English Bulldog and the now extinct Bullenbeisser.\n- The Bullenbeisser became extinct through crossbreeding rather than through decadence of the breed.",
